Timing is everything in showbiz, and in 1952,

748
00:39:06,421 --> 00:39:10,420
Potato Head became the toy industry's first media hit.

749
00:39:10,421 --> 00:39:13,420
You stick in eyes, then ears.

750
00:39:13,421 --> 00:39:16,420
You can make the funniest-looking people in the whole world.

751
00:39:16,421 --> 00:39:19,420
Potato Head became the toy industry's first media hit.

752
00:39:19,421 --> 00:39:20,920
in the whole world.

753
00:39:20,921 --> 00:39:23,420
In his first incarnation, Mr. Potato Head

754
00:39:23,421 --> 00:39:26,420
required an actual potato.

755
00:39:26,421 --> 00:39:30,420
In 1964 came the plastic version.

756
00:39:30,421 --> 00:39:33,420
Since then, Mr. Potato Head has played many roles.

