00:39:42,421 --> 00:39:44,420
Perhaps there are more productive ways

762
00:39:44,421 --> 00:39:48,420
to spend a Sunday afternoon than to launch potatoes from a gun.

763
00:39:48,421 --> 00:39:53,420
But for Joe Bell and Jason Lilly, viewer is fun.

764
